 55→// InstallHooks installs Cursor hooks in .cursor/hooks.json.
 56→// If force is true, removes existing Entire hooks before installing.
 57→// Returns the number of hooks installed.
 58→// Unknown top-level fields and hook types are preserved on round-trip.
